# Private notes: everyone sees, changes, and deletes only their own notes.
Identity
    Registration Enabled

Entity Note
    Field Title Text(200)
    Field Body Text(10000)?
    Field Pinned Boolean = False
    Field Owner -> Identity

    Present
        Listing
            Fields Title, Pinned
        Details
            Fields Title, Body, Pinned
        Editing
            Mode Modal
            Fields Title, Body, Pinned

# 'By Owner' on Create means people can only create notes they own, so the
# app fills in Owner for them. On Read it filters every list to your notes.
Action Create, Read, Update, Delete Note
    By Owner
    OrderBy Title
